/P 99 0 R
/E (      Graduation brings excitement, uncertainty, and a sense of freedom for seniors leaving high school. With classes, sports, and exams finally ending, many students are looking towards a freedom-filled summer that will be both a break from school and college preparation. To see what this looks like for the Class of 2026, an anonymous survey was sent out asking seniors to share their post-grad plans. The responses included a little bit of everything, from internships and jobs to travel, rest, and fun. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [15]
>>
