/E (In the past 25 years, however, it has changed more drastically than the 250 years before. The school has replaced tradition with comfort, and we are not better for it. Part of the appeal of prep schools is that they are preppy. When you dress well, you feel good, and that translates to increased confidence inside and outside of the classroom. We should strive to be a school that is better dressed than the eighth graders coming for tours. )
