<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (      But perhaps this is how we should look every day so that we can honor the history and beauty of the campus. Looking presentable on a day like Accepted Students Day is crucial because it sends a strong, positive message to the new kids and parents. The way we present ourselves contributes to how others perceive not just individual students, but the entire community. But it can also affect how we see ourselves and our place in the long tradition of GDA. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [43]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (      We sent out a survey asking if Govs should have a stricter dress code or not, and 160 people responded. Overall, 60% said we should keep the current dress code, and 40% wanted something more formal. Of the faculty that responded, 75% of the responses were in favor of a stricter dress code.  This survey does not conclusively suggest that we should reinstate a stronger dress code, but it does hint at a desire to consider some changes to the rules we have now.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [44]
>>
endobj
