/P 102 0 R
/E ( As a boarding student who lives only 30 minutes away, I used to always consider appealing to switch to day student status. Why move my life somewhere else if I can just commute every day? After four years of sticking it out and serving as a dorm proctor, I can honestly say that I made the right decision. My experience has been mostly positive, though there are benefits to both the boarding and day student experiences.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (      One difference between boarders and day students is the access to resources on campus. When you are boarding, your life revolves around campus. It is easy to access the library throughout the day and no hassle to meet with teachers after afternoon program. You can even go to the dining hall for a quick snack. There is a good deal of convenience when it comes to being on campus.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
