/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (    Last year, the Govs girls varsity lacrosse team went undefeated in ISL play and advanced to the ISL championship for the second year in a row. Coming off of an impressive season, the question now is whether the team can repeat that success and bring the championship to Byfield.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (     A defining moment of last season came when we defeated Nobles 13-9 in regular season play, breaking their six-year undefeated streak in the ISL. In a league as prestigious as the ISL, that win made a big statement. However, when we met them again in the ISL championship, Govs fell short, losing 7-9, allowing them to win their third championship in a row. In such a competitive league, matchups like Nobles will demand even greater focus and preparation. We have hopes to redeem ourselves, and beat them this year. Thayer and Tabor also look strong for the season.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
