/E (   An AI-rich world will not reward whoever writes fastest; instead, it will reward the ability to judge. It will reward those with the ability to say, here is what I think, here is why, and here is what would change my mind. You can be successful with the facilitation tool of AI, but only if you refuse its most tempting offer: the crutch.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [21]
>>
